s16:s15,s13:elrpd |- ( ( M e. ( ZZ>= ` 2 ) /\ N e. ( ZZ>= ` M ) ) -> ( log ` M ) e. RR+ )
i17::ell2val
s18:s7,i17:syl |- ( ( M e. ( ZZ>= ` 2 ) /\ N e. ( ZZ>= ` M ) ) -> ( ell2 ` M ) = ( log ` ( log ` M ) ) )
